  "description": "Boba Fett and company return to Mos Espa once more, this time heading directly to city hall. Inside, Fett demands to see the mayor and is deflected by both the receptionist and the mayor's majordomo. Walking directly past them, Boba charges in to confront the Ithorian mayor called Mok Shaiz. Shaiz eliminates the assassin and claims ignorance about the attempt on Fett, offering him a bounty for turning in a member of the Night Wind. Boba accepts, but only considers the payment the tribute owed to him by the mayor."
